    "Learner: The tutors disagreed about my example. Partner: Did they give reasons? Learner: Yes. But both said my conclusion added an unsupported claim. Partner: Start with the shared issue. Learner: I will remove that claim and clarify the example. Partner: How will you check the change transfers? Learner: Write a fresh essay without assistance, then request another review. Partner: Keep both drafts so you can explain what changed.":  "audio/b1f33a50c8b60cf1.mp3",
