    "Tutor: Your chart overview says all categories increased. Check the camera figures. Student: They fell from eighty to sixty. Tutor: Good. Which category remained highest? Student: Laptops. Tutor: And which more than doubled? Student: Audio recorders, from forty to ninety. Tutor: Use those broad patterns in the overview. Do not explain the changes by saying students became richer; the chart contains no income data.":  "audio/da04694b4d2e3fb2.mp3",
